Subject: [PATCH] fix(BUG-40D0E1BE): stream visual observations

Keep Looking live after the structured summary by projecting the newest observation, then restore the summary once settled. Suppress generic trailing Tool activity when a keyed view owns inline activity, completing BUG-BA3AD2DC.

diff --git a/packages/client/ui-tool/src/client/tool/ToolCallTree.module.css b/packages/client/ui-tool/src/client/tool/ToolCallTree.module.css
